                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A commercial lasting 60 seconds."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5436177-2748-4b1a-9d68-72819cefc346",
                                                "sense_id": "5ff39357-f281-3f7d-b147-2ba34a320a21",
                                                "text": "[…] instead of thirties [thirty-second commercials], they buy sixties, which cost twice as much. They spend more on filming it than they need to; they buy a lot of ads that are garbage and don't really say anything, just to fill up the space."
